ArchBang KEYBINDINGS
═════════════════════

NOTE: Super = Windows Key


APPLICATIONS
───────────────────────

Super + Return          Terminal (foot)
Super + Space           Launcher (rofi)
Super + a               Omunchy Menu (omunchy menu)
Super + b               Web Browser (chromium)
Super + e               File Manager (thunar)
Super + s               System Monitor (dgop)
Super + k               Show Keybindings


WINDOW CONTROLS
───────────────────────

Super + q               Close Window
Super + t               Toggle Float
Super + f               Fullscreen
Super + v               Toggle Split


FOCUS & MOVEMENT
───────────────────────

Super + ←/→/↑/↓         Focus Direction
Super + Shift + ←/→/↑/↓  Move Window
Super + Tab              Next Workspace
Super + Shift + Tab      Previous Workspace


WORKSPACES
───────────────────────

Super + [1-9]           Switch to Workspace
Super + Shift + [1-9]   Send Window to Workspace


MULTI-MONITOR
───────────────────────

Super + Alt + Left/Right        Focus Monitor


SYSTEM
───────────────────────

Super + l               Lock Screen
Super + r               Reload Config
Super + p               Screenshot (full)
Super + Shift + s       Screenshot (region)
Super + Shift + e       Power Menu

Vol Up (XF86)           Increase Volume
Vol Down (XF86)         Decrease Volume
Mute (XF86)             Toggle Mute
Bright Up/Down (XF86)   Screen Brightness
